WHAT IS IN THIS REPOSITORY
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

  - The source of the Vespera plugin (vespera-core, vespera-plugin).
  - The development launcher (vespera-dev) that fetches a server and starts it.
  - World *descriptions*, not world data: layout files written by hand, and
    (once the art exists) structure files made by this project's builders.
  - Documentation.

Everything here is either written for this project or is a plain-text
description of something a person decided.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
WHAT IS NOT IN THIS REPOSITORY
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

  - No Minecraft client or server jar. No paper.jar, no vanilla jar, no patched
    jar, and nothing of the sort anywhere in the history.
  - No server software (Paper, Spigot, Bukkit, Purpur, Folia).
  - No third-party plugin jars (mmSupernaturals, Citizens, WorldEdit, WorldGuard,
    LuckPerms, ...). They are obtained locally by whoever runs this; see
    plugins.tsv.
  - No Mojang assets: no textures, sounds, language files, fonts, or models.
  - No world region files. Those contain players' builds, chests and footprints,
    and they never belong in a repository.

