WHAT YOU SUPPLY YOURSELF
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

A Paper server and a copy of Minecraft you are licensed to run. The development
launcher downloads Paper from PaperMC's own API into target/ — that directory is
ignored by git and is never committed. Paper is GPL-3.0; downloading it and
running it on your own machine is what its licence is for. Redistributing it is
a different act, with different obligations, and this project does not do it.

